{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1485,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0b6f7a9fa7439f0e18d9587",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02174a7ee1393725b6eabecf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "痛痛痛……赖床起不来时\r\n我会在地板上滚来滚去，\r\n今天好像有点滚太久了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d14c363c45c1d7c1cacccf78306c0e11def755b8000e680f3f637c225abbbc3c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fc7cb46147758281b738e5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勉强赶上了～哎呀～我本来以为\r\n自己起得很早，然后顺利到校了……\r\n但看来那只是一场梦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0482f545abcf13ff15899633a5db173c8c904877bd7122ec8b61c2492b92271",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:977a5c332ccfb3d0bf9956f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道午餐一定要吃能够摄取到丰富\r\n胺基酸的鱼类与蔬菜……但想归想，\r\n哎唷～人家还是很想吃甜食啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "961a0be34b9467243709a82e34f3319acca9f596e50fa05dffdd3698f818022d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04c4771133ac912f3d2feb72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "传来调味酱的味道……！？\r\n这是……什锦烧？……不对，\r\n是炒面才对。什锦烧没这么甜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0187f18376827fbe6b70d26a5216574706ab9fde888d56b2ae7f545c546d446a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0737a5bfb52204570a92db8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等你工作结束后，我来帮你\r\n指压按摩吧！我对一些有助于放松的\r\n穴道可是略～知一二哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31b8d13788225a1e5d5baf1ac4a4dbc02d92250478fb6634c5ce49a9fdea0485",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71c1fad1296e15de24530fa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好像很累呢。嗯～\r\n告诉你我亲身体验过后选出的\r\n最佳温泉旅馆前三名吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b2863b69be183ebdd0dcd0ac76794cf944bcad56ee383a340d8e519d6d8b89e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9aed6964fb44e005c12a7f3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花的季节真的很棒对吧！身上堆满\r\n花瓣，然后闻着樱花香气睡午觉……\r\n嗯～真是棒极了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3baa77b10eb4a659064cae6b113aea78238dab472ae0051d082cffc53f5abb9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dff27d85b87b0afb3d36a5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到夏天就想到海！……不过我\r\n其实不太会游泳～也不擅长换气，\r\n还会不小心把水吸进鼻子里……",
      "source_fingerprint": "c13d76f71d74b3529f6fee82957116888d1983d21c2ee3f823908b6e5a7d570d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c9ea87cb5508c661304930c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "运动之秋来了呢。\r\n以前我们全家会开会讨论\r\n秋天要去看GⅠ竞赛还是足球呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f99c10aedc05778836a72c96feec50cced96d384e3b7ab99b62287816909b6c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e94171231cfc47b939fdf55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天气这么冷，真的会让人完全打消\r\n从被窝里出来的念头呢～\r\n难道就不能包着棉被活动吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7101fd7154a1d1082508f971d875747f387f97db37a705fab05756be3e420dc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1de368177623aa0c49896ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:affbf82efa96604c04203c32",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我查了小琴常讲的那些东西，结果\r\n出现北欧神话？超人？之类的……\r\n反而让我越来越搞不懂了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "347fb6c617f3cf23c276061f2a8bb7def2591129b2b1c4c8a03aaa7792e6b582",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61a3bf2f39e4abdd1ce6e195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小克很擅长玩比谁先笑喔～\r\n至今我屡战屡败，\r\n真希望总有一天能让她笑出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd0ac93bd8f9039eec0a4718bab5763acdaa36b02830afbd7f94d556589822f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6eb12f2d9d55509037714f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有时我会跟小妙他们一起踢足球，\r\n她身边那些人踢后卫踢得超好喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "79298f6155c0e9f914d308b376e5e8f07d29fc3caa2fd2804665cbfb5560b794",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd897f2c9e60bebb19bdd1ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小路真的很有踢足球的资质呢～\r\n有时会忍不住怀疑她\r\n该不会是专业选手吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "15306a4ba7ce81704673b351b075db6828d3207cb6ef2b9723b8b22863802a75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bb598c766ed8da7eab96621",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最我来说最棒的假日是去逛家具行！\r\n到处试躺试坐各种床铺跟沙发，\r\n一天很快就过去了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2beff32a007e2fb398fd605fd8e083fb5040173d4e20c4a286e204b0311d20c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b37611e8172937ccf382651c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然会觉得反正是特别的服装嘛～\r\n但偶尔还是会恢复理智，\r\n心想「好想把肚子遮起来啊」……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d644a22eb0f1a576dc3d10032cfa0ff03be2f2a6a4fc458017f1ab8d6917eb78",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72b713dde4a86c2a4bd89986",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我总是很犹豫是否该响应粉丝……\r\n因为我会忍不住担心对方究竟\r\n是不是在对我挥手啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "3054215d1bd7a669f1c68c0628267aec3621ad78ae60a83623ab29879fac1a27",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01e612bf64f300aa002e5a95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套决胜服穿起来很舒适。\r\n腰间的皮带是伸缩材质制成的，\r\n所以穿起来很放松哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bc3dca70a59d72d0c3b16b986e60b44f83828c5901321c5252c64717622f4ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29c1c317b99e7a95b1779b1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比方说左右颜色不同的鞋子啦，\r\n或是小小的菱形之类的～耶嘿嘿，\r\n我很喜欢这种有点特别的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aef766ff36cd966af20c476a41690601cc68c1fc8385889a52c4e42081aa3f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65f754bee5c832bcb6d13d82",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我早上总是需要发呆好一段时间。\r\n我很喜欢躺在被窝中\r\n看着天花板逐渐变亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71b6dc1f315a82b4990dc7b3eb3998e45078288b4aae61a65d8bbf18028823dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9e63b0f4e0c349cbb95ff12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次吃完午餐就困～～到不行……\r\n下午上课写的笔记上的字迹基本上\r\n都长得像蚯蚓一样歪七扭八的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "72e9737b40dabde6067f79a238c59b39d899b23183c900e7cd57639e9dac820f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38095c5c94398194871b3544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我迅速入眠的秘方，是把滴了\r\n一滴精油的毛巾放在枕头旁边。\r\n好闻的香气可帮助我睡得很熟喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb75e6c72f53b2d7b077cb1d1db742047e8385cc6f54520fd34bae0e4ff4a89b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f4efbd01ce298a7ac5a5a9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "温暖的晴天真的很棒呢～\r\n赛道的草地就像高级地毯一样，\r\n跑起来很舒畅喔～",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc25d17cd13788288f114c79d786cb0509cde9d934d257b2eb8d631dcabe03b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a70529df644642ca4fb3d48e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好热……就算坐在高级沙发上\r\n也无法放松，但什么都不做\r\n还是会热得受不了……唔呃……",
      "source_fingerprint": "db4a664318d517d5557837419047a0d691e668792b2f19b2e09ea3a95fee2549",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f3cfae36de91c6f006d6192",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来为落叶地毯评分，\r\n身体埋入感跟包覆感无可挑剔……\r\n可是会弄脏衣服，所以我给七十分！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d79438bcc93e800e03adac4b75aaecdf53560a29fb8da8b7f65bc6a3339043a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:316826def77ad529e6b523e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "雪屋很棒喔～在里头点起\r\n香氛蜡烛，就会被光芒包围，\r\n可以度过一段很悠闲的时光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b173c69e21a73ac34b03000ddb8e192cc8a022da1f0d22e31cd232aa77f37746",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e2d96a443778fcbc25f6b65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我睡得很好，\r\n所以现在比平时更有干劲喔～！\r\n……我是指跟平时相比啦，嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7574572ad03c6414f4760c816900234824fe2d62f88a0aaec1cac6094cd6ec0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:580eeb011c9d9698c198f4a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うん、がんばろー",
      "source_fingerprint": "82628f814b53c6ce5a6f201f7d15d8f4cb06278add3197f1f443ce76b0134392",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9975838a9f7c846ba5515544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我随时可以开始训练喔～\r\n无论是跑坡道还是重训……\r\n啊，可是要在不会太累的范围内……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fdb2b94618df13180e4052fbbe59dc5065eb15bc732111e5e0c04d00fff8f70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20c5cce29285f571d1fd7c98",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好的～我会加油的。\r\n毕竟现在是训练时间嘛。\r\n就尽量啦……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dc1d18e0a9f7da9834f77bace3bc8bdb8b1ef811d0c373754a58aa6af3a688f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3de8e79a47360c83d67c05c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要准备训练了对吧……\r\n嗯……我想也是啦……\r\n但要先看看内容再决定～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b599e6b468b8590f83e7cbeb0da1d32bd2147c9a51621b05e02b440f84903b21",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5587162547be579dae50158e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不过啊，一旦受到信任后……\r\n果然会觉得自己「还是尽可能地\r\n努力一下好了～」，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "05f9bcdc7b35402f04a7be2cac208c79815b0bf7d3f54567b5050bc858815bc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e39773a738e5948deb33028f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是我变得让大家能够\r\n抬头挺胸地说要为我加油……\r\n一定很令人高兴吧～嗯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a1c27b30edf2e4883a632567f67f1cafd963a35073ba8f9638dd33c66afea74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee048dd832de38c47f93cabb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前我总是只能祈祷奇迹出现，\r\n但现在的我只要努力或许奇迹就……\r\n唔嗯～应该是要非常努力……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "02f1374c66688498309bc95440ad027e12e05e8a1c43bcf8609dc8898d458ce7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47b7ee5637bd99a1756dd27e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "美丽的沙滩真的很棒吧～\r\n……我可没有想做沙滩冲刺喔？\r\n一律以悠闲为前提。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cfc6ebab956e86e257025818bb69cd96904b5103da283808b13e47e6e48e92b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d1beb9293965ba7c1feec31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "原来你就是我的奇迹啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8356f5dd089ca4e0c4484d7fe5c0a544cbfb665e08cc084e1e4891d38bec990b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7a850b6271647989dc68d41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们一起引发了奇迹呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9908c5d085eea3908a9a01dd1ce6fd9c62845badab22fe5324d6fbe1fba08326",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d1922fc6a1c0e2595343b04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还能再多努力一下吗～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ea74e33c8f0e17ae270461d9a82e03e2184e10495d18d3dc44c5a32cb9b05f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cddf79bdff64ab82869a29c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咦，我好像突破了一道高墙……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc0f1496f2de112882a45062984d438fa6da2be6d7163a45f8095963e033a207",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea9dba4deedaba28f9035b04",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是菱钻奇宝。\r\n我会适度地努力的哦～",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ae273f4d02da1ba5a01f9c117c8c03b9bee06d9be73163b35ff5d464144909f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:735defa48ad403d146e6b212",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管再怎么对我抱有期待，\r\n我也只是个普通赛马娘啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b14b73196c8fde2f172ea00f70f6e328cb53f30a2bbd58f76c05f49c4aed5b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73d6a4e36681097f11f32bae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頼りがい出てきたかな～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a8a975c3cd25fa2dbdde718f54f34dc85631f5abd4b6a9085aeba69a2bd90dc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cba160e6c4e3dafa2967e83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目覚めたかも…なにかに！",
      "source_fingerprint": "609f127b908e5c3ce7c0c61a16237cc0ae8cc2deddc9658af4ea4e6993ad671b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1106",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fe42c3d99c722dac0947b3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシと踊ろうぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9ff1ea38137289c0d193bac34e11806842427c9d94d1601d6027e6d94fbcb50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f7cd2ae69806efe5df19923",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロマンの前には現実だって\r\n頭を垂れるのさ。さあ、\r\n宝探しに乗り出すぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "105da9f23a80a43537771e3d9d6b7bb17b00be9862a8b2c9ae23ab488cea420c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0d0f841a5bf31259ad42ee4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7da79748cc0c78260452eff6f93ce5c5aa46913a8d4199c892b59c4e329c3594",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb1117dacc2797d235869aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d18f79da33c356a433357d86ef63d6f12d0393bf7a401aa168fbc536b2b3d56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b503ac8b3f5346137ceefa97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシの城を建てた暁には、\r\nアンタも招待してやるよ。\r\n一生踊り続けようぜ、航海士殿？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c0e74ffce66d54fe8533b39d2d43349ccdfb8fef20559eea8ab51722ec1a730",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb26327e5e00967822a15403",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "そこにロマンがある限り、\r\nアタシたちの冒険は終わらない！\r\nってことで次の航海の相談いいか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "90281c83adb5557490933041ccc1219b367418ae266cd561b0d2a7175d152c04",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc0e700659b9852c6d612b77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おせち…料理でゲン担ぎとは\r\n面白い！フフフッ…富の象徴\r\n栗きんとんはアタシのもんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64ae417902ceb14a3a71bd281de007ff6ec55af850cbdbcfaff40a70555f0491",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0682f8c56a8a30c61182fb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カカオが金の時代なら、今日の\r\nアタシはとんだ金持ちだな！\r\n山ほどチョコをもらっちまったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3f87f618b029739da0f0fa0a912c58ad34a79431e7c3bd90c49af0cf3828cdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7c1b59257e5f3e511aba140",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アメリカじゃ、バレンタインには\r\n花を渡すのさ…てことで、チョコの\r\n花だ！食えるほうがいいだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e9e8339ed4effd4877f8b54f462521c6d2c5c1956d027afb3a99b810b14ab0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbb74a40d8010c97a3f65415",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "七夕伝説だっけ？No way!\r\nアタシならdadは蹴とばして、\r\n一生2人で遊んで暮らすけどな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c27362b31cfdfcc4f20bbb88724a890cda1a6ea80bfe87d1b58a01a257b2ba6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ab73ffcefde51cbd6f4dd29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海賊、吸血鬼、天使に悪魔…さあ、\r\nなんにでもなれる日だ！Ghostも\r\nビックリの変身を見せてやろうぜ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f72597d76581f15594758ba6ff6e1c233689e99ed1066f23fcc5e6c6fc6f58a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b321198b81efa4c371e482e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大金持ちになったら、世界中の\r\n子どもにプレゼントの雨を降らせる\r\nのもいいな！アンタもやるだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a62cbb7d2e0ff2fa00dc8bc088b19b481595124d66e63fe0443b09bb0dab553",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5766ddc92992c95e2b63d629",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "街にあふれる色とりどりの宝石を\r\n見にいこう！夜だけに輝くお宝だ、\r\n儚き光を共に愛でようじゃないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "34520bec762e3e270bfd68f0ce95281cd911b044417766d1df071d922d04b775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f70c9e179bdbaf53a433f00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1261f3e6beb8e54e8469047c9faf777378f5fc44447fe34858d1ec905ad77e6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b22d55bfe31d1a3b75a2b501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "108個の欲を落とす鐘だって？\r\nなら、アタシは1000個持つ！\r\nアタシから欲を消すのは不可能さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd4bb75fd74380367dfedcae43b67a97bea91cd5fee162d06d673d0875218bd1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:364e319c5c43b9f339d5765b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Happy birthday to you!\r\nさあ、歌って踊ろうぜ！1年に1度\r\nしかないアンタの日に、乾杯！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c252aad3dec0e7df77a823ec0a7cc3c26b67979f362a504f35974ed35e9cc00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b07f9fdf6db3bbb74a766300",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よぉ、主役！今日は1日、豪遊って\r\nもんを教えてやるよ！あとで\r\nノンアルシャンパンタワー作るぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b280b67b79cf2a80959ead84ed13aad1b88333925b56cfbf1bd8a55ef404e144",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7ff8c49f68b4d7e58da027d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年もヘリオスにもらったミラボが\r\n輝く日がやってきたな。アンタも\r\nダンスしに来いよ！絶対だぞ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "43704babdcffd5b863b312ceb5078fff36d87d2c65e7544c5e340f534db31d4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:779b2687f479d257593dc384",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、祝ってくれ！アンタからの\r\n宝を心待ちにしてたんだ！部屋に\r\n飾るスペースは用意した！さあ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ab8a572b13cf067cade9abbdb73b812a915ba5cebc9486fe3ee7d2bda178ad6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dce08104c86bf2e51fe6874c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お知らせがあるようだ。\r\nよーし、確認は任せた！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5184a546a0ee3cdffe698c6b0a99720d256e386fd0b23d09d5a726a96195ce2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7837ebad82d4b05f4b0fcd2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プレゼントだって！？\r\nAwesome!早くもらいに行こう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bffce8bad96b0ae5fa5a828025c345cd83494dbdaabe2778761957d69a4ce80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aadc336778e957840ff15f44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いいねぇ、報酬！いつ聞いても\r\n胸躍る言葉だ！もらい忘れるなよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d11587a4eb70646537e9ad623040d0a968a36b8f07dc736e68ed59507afdcdd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b272713409f48e5a79d3f19c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントがあるってさ！\r\nI'm so pumped!\r\n待ち遠しいな、なぁ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcd06f15fbc3b85aff0b6d05cf9a32bef828d90d2b981907a82f119b349d7683",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e30263da8b333876ff3aba4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イベントが始まったぞ！\r\n1分1秒が惜しい、今すぐ参加だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "117f85fc61219bd4686292d03aaf605e1fea609e801821f8f44652ea1fe9f64b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea8fb26416b7b99961e04bce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…次があるさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31dbb85eddfe75524bba09aaf82b5d5c36b4cc699215da9a9c468c4303a6c63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ec27d2f120c588d693b909",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ウマ娘名鑑のレベルが上がったぞ！\r\nやるじゃないか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b6476e371aef17e1e527ee93219968d7674108888badbaf8ca7a96cf7734857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8545a04ebc342461f52409df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん～、惜しい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a79801c2cb7efe57df9d86c0d0b14fbc3204171c739e8faaf2d02b1314d4b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ee129cdb6065e17f9507a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヒュウ！宴だな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "972754e890719ccbef93cebd8923a1a29a6a40b6c96fae5bea6ed8de0aa4d7f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d3bd9c53da96367204d5b93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…次があるさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b31dbb85eddfe75524bba09aaf82b5d5c36b4cc699215da9a9c468c4303a6c63",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecaaa4f040b8512e40b1e0d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ん～、惜しい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a79801c2cb7efe57df9d86c0d0b14fbc3204171c739e8faaf2d02b1314d4b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2611d67f1834c06b0e97aa3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Wow!ハイスコア更新だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "802beec9d7052210dbd3b5cd33b899c87f9171f6475c7500d0cd8f2a391f603b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75900de7a050c06c782b43a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "躍れ躍れっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ad3884645a7f5339866b481a0c08447440583a137f9a27a7341f22b7647b768",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cdd4676060e742827f8f16c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5cc2ffa2600940e47c39d39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hey、トレーニングの計画か？\r\n考えるのはアンタに任せた！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0529a0eb4baa3b81354c94cfd4936b7c20896f8a523fc3e5845b2fb634396df4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6fa1db1eae72fe16a863e43c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仲間との思い出ってやつは\r\nいつまでも色あせない宝なのさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeb50f82e08c61e2d547c910d697addb366f72c311caf40258b3bf1382c2d7ba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
